    and if you destroyed a monster, this card gains ATK equal to that monster''s
    original ATK until the end of this turn. If this face-up Synchro Summoned card
    in its owner''s control leaves the field by an opponent''s card: You can Special
    Summon 1 "Clear Wing" monster from your Extra Deck.'
